{"version":1,"key":"card:115","content":{"id":115,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dd886446-e30b-48e1-9f75-c9f335d2c44d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果第一次接触 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Linux"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 系统的话，会发现 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Linux"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Windows"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有很多不一样的地方，比如目录结构。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Windows"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以分为好几个盘符，例如 C 盘，D 盘等等，在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Linux"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中没有盘符的概念，所有的文件都在一个目录下面，我们称其为根目录，我们先看下根目录下面有哪些东西"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"c95217cf-8faf-402e-bf65-6acbfbb4f5e5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c24d38ef-2600-4d8e-856d-455a4c56fff7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"/\n├── bin -> usr/bin\n├── boot\n├── dev\n├── etc\n├── home\n├── init\n├── lib -> usr/lib\n├── lib32 -> usr/lib32\n├── lib64 -> usr/lib64\n├── libx32 -> usr/libx32\n├── media\n├── mnt\n├── opt\n├── proc\n├── root\n├── run\n├── sbin -> usr/sbin\n├── snap\n├── srv\n├── sys\n├── tmp\n├── usr\n└── var","collabId":"49c993ee-1e42-419e-9442-86f494835545","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f715698-1d53-4294-8dc1-2070ecabb1e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在根目录下的每个目录都有其作用。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"c1590357-52d3-411e-a4a5-3121ed65101d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3928cb3e-77fd-4859-82c1-54504d2884e9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3f51ec7f-c38b-46d4-b8ce-2e106b53d63c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"235e9782-128d-4ce3-b674-7fbab59e7e2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bin 是 binary 的缩写，其中保存的是二进制可执行文件，一些常见的命令就存在在其中，例如 ls。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a3219aee-1ed9-4757-9ee2-ea79597cf52d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e4470fa2-46dc-4937-8ccc-de882c6cdfd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sbin 存放的也是二进制可执行文件，不过其中的文件只有超级管理员才能执行，也就是 root 用户才能执行，用户可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sudo"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令暂时提升权限执行其中的一些命令。其中的一些命令如果错误的使用将会对系统造成破坏，所以谨慎使用。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"9775ba31-bb20-42b4-9ed7-7f23b6edabef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fafe5c22-c23d-4abb-a24f-fc62dc448e8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sbin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的意思。"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"032084cf-b04f-4276-8917-c2feacba74e5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c8b2bb40-48e0-46b1-9037-d69d94e3f8aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"lib* 存放的是一些库文件，其中包含了显卡，声卡，WiFi，打印机等等驱动程序。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"18d75186-76b1-448a-90d1-b4e5f18fca7b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e63e7714-da95-456f-a790-b52b55dc9492","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"home 目录是用来存放个人文件的目录，对于用户 alice 来说，系统会为该用户在该目录下生成一个名为 alice 的文件夹，用户 alice 可以在这里保存自己的个人文件。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c67daa1b-b5c8-46b0-954b-1db4c198938d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79ed9619-2952-4120-ac9f-2517bf759920","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"root 用户与一般的用户不同，它的个人目录不在 home 目录下，而是在根目录下，所以根目录下的 root 目录就是 root 用户的个人目录。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6689e9ef-d795-401d-adbe-896640f585b8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddbf9038-b832-4e02-beca-735cc2109f3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tmp 用来存放一些应用程序产生的临时文件，这些文件通常包含一些应用程序不需要的数据，系统会自动删除其中 10 天未用的文件，并且系统重启之后会清空该目录。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ccc6c12c-9aec-4760-b2cf-7956fb460020","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"781a0580-dadb-4d43-b4ce-fbd9b3ba53da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"boot 目录中包含了启动系统所需要的文件，所以千万不要动里面的东西，如果你一不小心搞乱了里面的文件，有可能就导致系统无法启动。当然你也不需要担心一不小心破坏了系统，因为做这种事情需要超级管理员权限。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5aeba81f-a8b2-417f-8a18-e827d76dd6c6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"305b77e0-0cde-4af3-a3b2-756e5259bf05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"etc 的名字可能有点误导，它是 \"et cetera\"(诸如此类)的缩写，因为在早期它用来存放一些系统管理员不知道放在哪里的文件，就像是一个杂货间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"690cfe86-49ca-4eb6-8b14-e13094dfd6da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在，它常常用来放置一些与系统有关的配置文件，例如用户及其密码信息，网络配置，硬盘等信息，如果你是 `Linux` 新手的话，最好不要随意修改里面的文件。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"af9ce26e-8b76-4892-9984-b23d0346d4fa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83b5c755-7a08-4eb9-88d3-c14a3af95191","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"dev 目录中包含了设备文件，Linux 将所有的设备都抽象为文件，例如你的硬盘，对应于其中的一个文件，当你插入 U 盘后，也会在该目录下生成一个与之对应的文件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb97adbf-4b4d-4482-ab66-545179cb0693","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是想要访问硬盘里面的内容，我们需要将其挂载到某个目录，我们通过访问这个目录才能访问硬盘里面的内容，这个目录称为挂载点。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"0f7660d0-ae7d-4cb1-a6dd-a597d7d9044e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91e78c24-72ed-4bc4-8189-8033922ed343","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"挂载就可以理解为在 Windows 中的分配盘符，在 Windows 中会自动挂载，也就是会自动分配盘符，不需要手动挂载。"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7d7fb34e-0f96-4651-b067-3855c98c457d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86e8a8da-6f5f-4da2-8c3a-e0e1195dd3fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"proc 目录是一个虚拟目录，其中的文件并不存在于硬盘当中，而是存在于内存当中。它包含了有关于你的计算机的信息，例如 CPU 的信息，内核的信息。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ecd35652-71d4-42a9-b682-4cf960361d38","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2660791d-c939-4ad2-9893-faeea4974859","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sys 是另一个虚拟目录，其中的内容也是保存在内存当中，该目录保存了连接到你计算机上的设备的信息。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f194f3b3-56f4-437d-a2d1-35b812a57146","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f3115e2-05f4-4ae6-97e9-17d463749c3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"srv 包含服务器的数据。如果你正在运行一个 Web 服务器，你的 HTML 文件应该放在 srv/http 或者 srv/www 中。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"03d0b9c8-15c2-4d86-90d4-dd3b22d68418","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d409a1e-145b-46ec-8471-0d074652e232","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"opt 用来放置你手动从源码编译的软件，通过命令从仓库下载的软件会安装在 /usr/local 目录。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"104c20ae-eca5-4506-b4d7-35bcad2fc469","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d6d8e88-24ce-420a-a02f-9985df48eb0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"usr 早期是作为用户的家目录，但是现在已经被 home 目录取代。现如今，usr 是一个大杂烩，包含应用程序、库、文档、壁纸、图标和一系列需要被应用程序和服务共享的东西。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e4543ebf-c1bf-48dc-b6ea-d9a1a5172711","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5423d8db-b139-4706-9eec-72b04ddf6732","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"var 是 variable 的缩写，表示其中的内容是可变的，并且是频繁的改变，比如日志文件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08369781-fe5b-4e4b-9769-2833b8790f07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"日志会放置在 /var/log 这个子目录下，当内核执行出错的时候，就会在该目录下进行相应的记录，又比如有人入侵你的系统，你的防火墙也会试图在该目录下做出记录。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["Linux"],"createTime":1689255655252,"updateTime":1743303640392,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640392}}